cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this catalog, please cite it and the individual packages it indexes.
title: "Klimakatalog: a curated catalog of GenesisAeon climate science packages"
abstract: >
  Curated catalog of 47+ GenesisAeon climate-science packages (P17-P129),
  each with its own real, citable abstract, DOIs, and domain-theme tags
  (atmosphere, ocean, cryosphere, biosphere, hydrology, carbon cycle,
  society, extremes). Additionally exposes a semantic map (src/lib/catalog/
  cascade.ts): clusters and cross-cluster relationships compiled only from
  connections explicitly documented in a package's own abstract or README
  ("companion to", "extends the ... series", "bridges") -- not from
  thematic similarity or automated matching. Does not itself perform any
  climate modeling; it is a navigation layer over independently published
  packages.
version: "1.3.0"
date-released: "2026-09-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GenesisAeon/klimakatalog"
keywords:
  - GenesisAeon
  - climate
  - catalog
  - open-science
  - semantic map
authors:
